**Full texts:** the canonical license texts live at the URLs above. The complete
CC BY 4.0 legal code (several hundred lines) is deliberately **not** reproduced
here — the URL is the authoritative version. The MIT text is short and is
included in full below, because MIT only grants rights when the notice travels
with the work.

